<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Chislett Farms Inductions</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;background:#1a3a1a;color:#fff;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
:root{--green:#2D6A2D;--green-mid:#3a7a3a;--orange:#E8541A;--amber:#F5A623}
#app{width:100%;max-width:700px;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#1a3a1a}

#header{background:#fff;padding:14px 24px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--orange);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px}
#header svg{display:block}
#header p{font-size:12px;color:#555;text-align:center}

#hero{padding:28px 24px 8px;text-align:center}
#hero h1{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.2}
#hero p{font-size:14px;color:#b8d8b8;line-height:1.6;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto}

#cards{padding:16px 20px 32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}

.card{border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
.card-header{padding:16px 18px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.card-icon{font-size:32px;flex-shrink:0}
.card-header-text h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:2px}
.card-header-text p{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase}
.card-body{padding:0 18px 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}

.card-green{background:rgba(45,106,45,0.25);border:2px solid #3a7a3a}
.card-green .card-header{background:rgba(45,106,45,0.4)}
.card-green .card-header-text p{color:#5DCAA5}

.card-orange{background:rgba(232,84,26,0.12);border:2px solid rgba(232,84,26,0.4)}
.card-orange .card-header{background:rgba(232,84,26,0.2)}
.card-orange .card-header-text p{color:#F5A623}

.who-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#b8d8b8;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px}
.examples{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.example-tag{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#e0f0e0;font-weight:600}
.example-tag.green{background:rgba(93,202,165,0.15);color:#9FE1CB}
.example-tag.orange{background:rgba(245,166,35,0.15);color:#ffe4a0}

.not-sure{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#b8d8b8;line-height:1.5}
.not-sure strong{color:#fff}

.cta-btn{display:block;text-align:center;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 20px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;transition:opacity 0.2s;letter-spacing:0.3px}
.cta-btn:hover{opacity:0.88}
.cta-green{background:var(--green);color:#fff}
.cta-orange{background:var(--orange);color:#fff}

.duration{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:#b8d8b8}
.duration span{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;font-weight:600}

.divider{border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);margin:4px 0}

#footer{padding:20px 24px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)}
#footer a{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);text-decoration:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app">

<div id="header">
  <svg width="160" height="50" viewBox="0 0 160 50">
    <circle cx="25" cy="25" r="23" fill="#E8541A"/>
    <circle cx="25" cy="25" r="19" fill="#F5A623"/>
    <circle cx="25" cy="25" r="9" fill="#FFD060"/>
    <line x1="25" y1="6" x2="25" y2="44" stroke="#E8541A" stroke-width="1.3" opacity="0.7"/>
    <line x1="6" y1="25" x2="44" y2="25" stroke="#E8541A" stroke-width="1.3" opacity="0.7"/>
    <line x1="11" y1="11" x2="39" y2="39" stroke="#E8541A" stroke-width="1.3" opacity="0.7"/>
    <line x1="39" y1="11" x2="11" y2="39" stroke="#E8541A" stroke-width="1.3" opacity="0.7"/>
    <text x="56" y="22" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" font-weight="900" fill="#2D6A2D">CHISLETT</text>
    <text x="56" y="40" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#2D6A2D">FARMS</text>
  </svg>
  <p>Site Safety Inductions</p>
</div>

<div id="hero">
  <h1>Which induction do you need?</h1>
  <p>Before entering any Chislett Farms site, all people must complete the correct induction below. If you are unsure which one applies to you, ask the person who invited you onto site.</p>
</div>

<div id="cards">

  <!-- Staff Card -->
  <div class="card card-green">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div class="card-icon">👷</div>
      <div class="card-header-text">
        <h2>Staff Induction</h2>
        <p>For people who work here</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="duration">This induction takes approximately <span>10 to 12 minutes</span></div>
      <hr class="divider"/>
      <div class="who-label">This induction is for you if you are:</div>
      <div class="examples">
        <span class="example-tag green">Full-time staff</span>
        <span class="example-tag green">Part-time staff</span>
        <span class="example-tag green">Casual workers</span>
        <span class="example-tag green">Seasonal harvest workers</span>
        <span class="example-tag green">PALM scheme workers</span>
        <span class="example-tag green">Labour hire workers</span>
        <span class="example-tag green">New employees on their first day</span>
        <span class="example-tag green">Returning seasonal workers</span>
      </div>
      <div class="not-sure"><strong>Not sure?</strong> If you have been rostered on for shifts, have a timesheet, or are being paid to work here, use the Staff Induction.</div>
      <a class="cta-btn cta-green" href="index.html">Start Staff Induction</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Visitor Card -->
  <div class="card card-orange">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div class="card-icon">🪪</div>
      <div class="card-header-text">
        <h2>Visitor Induction</h2>
        <p>For people visiting the site</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="duration">This induction takes approximately <span>4 to 5 minutes</span></div>
      <hr class="divider"/>
      <div class="who-label">This induction is for you if you are:</div>
      <div class="examples">
        <span class="example-tag orange">Auditors (food safety, WHS, GLOBALG.A.P.)</span>
        <span class="example-tag orange">Government or regulatory inspectors</span>
        <span class="example-tag orange">Electricians and plumbers</span>
        <span class="example-tag orange">Mechanics and equipment technicians</span>
        <span class="example-tag orange">Irrigation or chemical contractors</span>
        <span class="example-tag orange">Delivery drivers</span>
        <span class="example-tag orange">Agronomists and consultants</span>
        <span class="example-tag orange">Sales representatives</span>
        <span class="example-tag orange">Family members visiting the farm</span>
        <span class="example-tag orange">Any other guest or visitor</span>
      </div>
      <div class="not-sure"><strong>Not sure?</strong> If you are here for the day and are not on a Chislett Farms roster or payroll, use the Visitor Induction. You will need to sign in and sign out using a unique visitor code.</div>
      <a class="cta-btn cta-orange" href="visitor.html">Start Visitor Induction</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div id="footer">
  Questions about which induction to complete? Contact your host or speak to the HR and Quality Assurance Manager.<br>
  <a href="mailto:gretchen@chislettfarms.com.au">gretchen@chislettfarms.com.au</a>
</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
